WEBVTT

00:00:22.450 --> 00:00:24.600 line:70%
Welcome to EPUREAU Côte d’Ivoire.

00:00:24.710 --> 00:00:27.450 line:70%
Over ten years in Côte d’Ivoire,
since 2015.

00:00:27.450 --> 00:00:31.200 line:70%
We specialise in drinking water treatment,

00:00:31.290 --> 00:00:35.050 line:70%
sanitation, hygiene
and wastewater treatment.

00:00:35.310 --> 00:00:38.150 line:70%
We are at the Exhibition Centre
to present

00:00:38.150 --> 00:00:41.200 line:70%
our expertise in water treatment.

00:00:48.870 --> 00:00:51.000 line:70%
We treat water to protect the environment

00:00:51.090 --> 00:00:55.050 line:70%
and meet the hygiene standards
set by Côte d’Ivoire.

00:00:55.210 --> 00:00:57.530 line:70%
At the exhibition, we met many visitors

00:00:57.530 --> 00:00:59.950 line:70%
who wanted to learn about our work,

00:01:00.030 --> 00:01:02.850 line:70%
others interested in partnerships,

00:01:03.510 --> 00:01:05.430 line:70%
equipment suppliers,

00:01:05.430 --> 00:01:09.000 line:70%
and people with promising prospects
for the future.

00:01:20.670 --> 00:01:22.430 line:70%
It was a great opportunity for us

00:01:22.430 --> 00:01:26.350 line:70%
to attend the 2026
Abidjan Infrastructure Exhibition.

00:01:26.550 --> 00:01:29.150 line:70%
During the exhibition, we were struck

00:01:29.710 --> 00:01:32.250 line:70%
by the very interesting people we met.

00:01:32.530 --> 00:01:34.990 line:70%
We found strong potential clients

00:01:34.990 --> 00:01:37.070 line:70%
and major public works projects

00:01:37.070 --> 00:01:38.950 line:70%
requiring wastewater treatment.

00:01:39.490 --> 00:01:42.000 line:70%
We aim to build on these contacts

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:44.000 line:70%
and get involved in projects

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:47.900 line:70%
that benefit communities
and property developers.

00:01:56.670 --> 00:01:59.670 line:70%
I came to EPUREAU’s stand

00:01:59.670 --> 00:02:01.070 line:70%
to learn about the company.

00:02:01.070 --> 00:02:04.500 line:70%
The information was very interesting.

00:02:04.670 --> 00:02:06.210 line:70%
I am quite satisfied

00:02:06.210 --> 00:02:08.870 line:70%
with my conversation
with the customer service team.

00:02:08.870 --> 00:02:11.670 line:70%
They explained everything EPUREAU does.

00:02:11.670 --> 00:02:14.530 line:70%
My name is Michael Condapas.
I am Technical Director

00:02:14.530 --> 00:02:17.150 line:70%
at Unicef Travaux.

00:02:17.250 --> 00:02:20.510 line:70%
I met the EPUREAU team here.

00:02:20.510 --> 00:02:23.350 line:70%
They seem very professional and competent

00:02:23.350 --> 00:02:24.710 line:70%
in drinking water treatment.

00:02:24.710 --> 00:02:27.230 line:70%
I hope we can work together

00:02:27.230 --> 00:02:30.570 line:70%
to advance projects and contribute
to Côte d’Ivoire’s development.

00:02:30.890 --> 00:02:33.290 line:70%
We are very pleased with this exhibition.

00:02:33.430 --> 00:02:35.930 line:70%
These three days have been
extremely interesting for us.

00:02:35.930 --> 00:02:38.430 line:70%
We thank SIA for this opportunity

00:02:38.430 --> 00:02:40.310 line:70%
to meet new people

00:02:40.310 --> 00:02:42.790 line:70%
and introduce ourselves

00:02:42.790 --> 00:02:45.730 line:70%
to all the visitors and partners
who were here.

00:02:45.870 --> 00:02:47.580 line:70%
Visit us at EPUREAU Côte d’Ivoire.

00:02:47.730 --> 00:02:50.100 line:70%
Reliable solutions for your satisfaction.
